# The build context only needs: Dockerfile, Makefile, src/, scripts/,
# packages/, repo/pacman.conf, iso-profile/. Everything below would otherwise
# be COPY'd into the image (lyw-test.img alone is 20G, and the chown -R layer
# doubles it — that's how the image hit 44GB and filled the disk).
lyw-test.img
*.img
*.iso
*.fd
.artools-work
.pkgcache
out
lyw-out
lyw
src/*.o
.git
